<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 106,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 106,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Monday's actual 106,000 head. Opening trade was not well established. Early sales of barrows and gilts were steady to $0.50 higher than the mid-session Monday. Top $49.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>			   Country		  Plant</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    46.50 -47.50	   47.50 -48.50</p>
<p>few			46.00  48.00	   47.00  49.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady. Top $50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.  40.00 -41.00	   41.00 -43.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   41.00 -43.00	   42.00 -45.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    45.00 -48.00	   46.00 -50.00</p>
</text>
